            <span>What's the difference between the two options?</span>
            <span class="tl-plus">+</span>
          </button>

          <div class="tl-faq-a">
            The main difference is therapist
            experience. Standard Therapist is
            the accessible option, while Highly
            Experienced Therapist gives you access
            to a more seasoned professional.
          </div>

        </div>


        <div class="tl-faq-item">

          <button
            type="button"
            class="tl-faq-q"
          >
            <span>Is my session private?</span>
